{"key": "[\"The Vedic world moves east, into the Kuru and Panchala lands. Its villages leave fine grey pottery painted in black at more than a thousand sites, often with iron tools. At Hastinapur the Ganga cut away part of the village. The Puranas tell of a king who left after a flood. The dig cannot say if it was the same one.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/painted-grey-ware.mp3", "duration": 19.490708, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "The"}, {"t": 0.31951980327868856, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "Vedic"}, {"t": 0.6390396065573771, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "world"}, {"t": 0.9585594098360657, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "moves"}, {"t": 1.2780792131147543, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "east,"}, {"t": 1.5975990163934428, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "into"}, {"t": 1.9171188196721314, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "the"}, {"t": 2.23663862295082, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "Kuru"}, {"t": 2.5561584262295085, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "and"}, {"t": 2.875678229508197, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "Panchala"}, {"t": 3.1951980327868856, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "lands."}, {"t": 3.514717836065574, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "Its"}, {"t": 3.8342376393442628, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "villages"}, {"t": 4.153757442622951, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "leave"}, {"t": 4.47327724590164, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "fine"}, {"t": 4.7927970491803285, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "grey"}, {"t": 5.112316852459017, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "pottery"}, {"t": 5.431836655737706, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "painted"}, {"t": 5.751356459016394, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "in"}, {"t": 6.070876262295083, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "black"}, {"t": 6.390396065573771, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "at"}, {"t": 6.70991586885246, "d": 0.31951980327868856, "w": "more"}, {"t": 7.029435672131148, "d": 0.31